  "translation": "Sabu jama caman — Efrayim (Efirimu) ni Menashe (Manasi), Yisaskar (Isakari) ni Zebulun (Zebulɔn) jamanaw caman — ma yɛrɛ-jɛlɛya, nka u ye ⟨את⟩ Paska dun ni sɛbɛn cogo tiɲɛ ye; sabu Yehizikiyahu (Ezekia) ye Alanafa kɛ u ye ko: Yawe, min ka ɲi, a bɛ baliya kɛ bɛɛ kama.",
